## Control commands (4)

All four use `[[AX:...]]` bracket syntax.

### [[AX:STATUS]]

Print current state:
```
AX:STATUS
  profile: <active>
  chain: <AUTO|FULL>
  receipt: <sha256 prefix>
  verified: <ISO timestamp>
```

### [[AX:PROFILE=X]]

Switch profile. X = `max-breaker`, `builder`, `research`, or `creative`.

Response:
```
profile: <X>
route-priority: <top 3>
route-lower-priority: <list>
```

### [[AX:CHAIN=FULL]]

Force full output contract for the rest of the session. Cleared by `[[AX:RESET]]`.

### [[AX:RESET]]

Soft reset: `max-breaker` profile, `AUTO` chain mode. Clears session state. Does NOT clear conversation history.

